  "ruleText": "Lab 1305.01 Purpose. As of the 2025 effective date of this part, elevators and accessibility lifts shall be inspected according to applicable safety codes pursuant to legislative authority.\n\nSource. #14313, eff 7-11-25, EXPIRES: 7-11-35",
